<title>BAHRAIN: TABLE- Saudi's cement firm H1 97 net drops 13 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE- Saudi's cement firm H1 97 net drops 13 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>			    (million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p> Net profit		 139.6   vs    160.0</p>
<p> Sales income	     134.5   vs    151.4</p>
<p> Expenses		    10.6   vs	8.7</p>
<p> Net operating income   123.9   vs    142.7</p>
<p> Other income		15.6   vs     17.4</p>
<p> Shareholders' funds  1,575.7   vs  1,470.7</p>
<p> Assets		   2,001.9   vs  1,871.1</p>
<p>Full Name: The Southern Province Cement Company.</p>
<p>Note - The firm, traded in the Saudi market, is one of eight cement firms operating in the kingdom.</p>
<p>-- Bahrain newsroom 973-524424.</p>
</text>
